# xsurf: its .moddata keys (kernel/dlm C3-1 section 3, C3-6 section 1) and
# the definition line, as the ABI kit's mkmod reads a Master.  One Master
# for both lines: no $cpu, the kit's fragment gives the line's.
# $match: the X-Surf-100 (1212:64) and the X-Surf (1212:17).
# $param intr: 2 = the level-2 interrupt after a self-test (polled when it
# fails), 0 = polled.
$modtype drv
$class boot
$match zorro:1212:64,zorro:1212:17
$majors c:56
$unload never
$param intr:int:2:0:2
$desc X-Surf and X-Surf-100 ethernet xsf (STREAMS/DLPI)
xsurf	xsurf
